#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-NMEA.rst:5 a8d66b8718ae4b638c81b4dbf19e82f3
msgid "NMEA 0183 Wind Vane"
msgstr "NMEA 0183 风向标"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-NMEA.rst:7 e6cf44cfc4254dc680b98cd4cc6d9ea5
msgid ""
"NMEA 0813 is a widely used maritime standard, this driver makes used of the "
"`MWV message "
"<https://gpsd.gitlab.io/gpsd/NMEA.html#_mwv_wind_speed_and_angle>`__ this is"
" used by many wind sensors sold for use on full-size sailboats. This example"
" shows a `Calypso Wired Standard anemometer "
"<https://calypsoinstruments.com/shop/product/ultrasonic-wired-"
"standard-81>`__ this is a ultrasonic anemometer that provides acuate wind "
"speed and direction in a small package. Typically ultrasonic anemometers are"
" more acuate than traditional wind vanes, particularly in low wind speeds."
msgstr ""
"NMEA 0813 是广泛使用的海事标准，本驱动使用 `MWV 消息 "
"<https://gpsd.gitlab.io/gpsd/NMEA.html#_mwv_wind_speed_and_angle>`__，该消息被众多为全尺寸帆船销售的风速传感器所采用。本示例展示了"
" `Calypso 有线标准风速仪 <https://calypsoinstruments.com/shop/product/ultrasonic-"
"wired-"
"standard-81>`__，这是一款超声波风速仪，能在小巧的封装中提供准确的风速和风向。通常，超声波风速仪比传统风向标更准确，尤其在低风速情况下。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-NMEA.rst:16 8c157055291b4e5f8b46921ec0c12a1d
msgid ""
"The NMEA driver can be selected by setting :ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` to"
" 4 and/or :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` to 4. The driver uses a"
" serial port, the selected :ref:`seral port's protocol<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` "
"should set to type 21 for WindVane.  For use with a wind vane the "
":ref:`WNDVN_DIR_OFS <WNDVN_DIR_OFS>` parameter can be set to account for any"
" offset between the wind vanes' forward direction that of the vehicle. "
"Electrical connection is slightly more complex as NMEA 0183 uses a RS-422 "
"signal. Commercial RS-422 to ttl logic level converters designed for use "
"with NMEA will make this connection easy however, they can be costly. It is "
"possible to use a RS-233 converter with most NMEA devices, these are much "
"more readily available. This example shows a MAX3232 based transceiver board"
" from SparkFun, for use with a expensive device such as a wind vane it is "
"recommended to buy from a reputable supplier, clone MAX3232 are common. Note"
" than the wire colors in the diagram may not match your device."
msgstr ""
"NMEA 驱动可通过将 :ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` 设为4和/或将 :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE "
"<WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` 设为4来选择。驱动使用串口，所选 :ref:`串口协议<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` "
"应设为类型21（风向标）。用于风向标时，:ref:`WNDVN_DIR_OFS <WNDVN_DIR_OFS>` "
"参数可用于补偿风向标前进方向与车辆方向之间的偏差。电气连接稍微复杂，因为 NMEA 0183 使用 RS-422 信号。专为 NMEA 设计的商业 "
"RS-422 转 TTL 电平转换器可简化此连接，但价格可能较高。对于大多数 NMEA 设备，也可使用 RS-232 "
"转换器，此类产品更容易获取。本示例展示了 SparkFun 的 MAX3232 "
"基础收发器板；对于风向标这类贵重设备，建议从信誉良好的供应商购买，MAX3232 的山寨品很常见。注意，图中的线颜色可能与您的设备不匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-NMEA.rst:26 8b54341bbf32405392d4bae31ce49979
msgid ""
"Although not required for normal operation on some NMEA devices have receive"
" inputs, these can be connected to the autopilot via the logic translator. "
"This allows ArduPilot to act as a :ref:`NMEA to USB adapter <common-serial-"
"passthrough>` for use with the manufacturers tools for updating the wind "
"vanes' firmware or configuration."
msgstr ""
"虽然正常操作不需要，但某些 NMEA 设备具有接收输入端，可通过逻辑电平转换器连接到飞控。这允许 ArduPilot 作为 :ref:`NMEA 转 "
"USB 适配器 <common-serial-passthrough>` 使用，以配合制造商工具更新风向标固件或配置。"
